{"id":"vod_hh_48567","vodId":"48567","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"传颂之物 二人的白皇","name_cn":"传颂之物 二人的白皇","date":"2022-01-01","year":"2022","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第28集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/50f3c73883917b44d9109375d6e9c37c.jpg"},"summary":"“拜托你了，小安。”从皇帝驾崩开始的大和动乱。大和的皇女?因毒杀安柱未遂而被追捕的右近卫大将?奥什特鲁他在战斗的最后，耗尽了假面的力量，肉体和灵魂化为了世界的一部分。临别之际，把安珠和耐耐的未来托付给了朋友哈克。从奥斯特鲁那里得到了假面和意志的哈克，放弃了哈克的人生，对除了唯一知道事实的奈科内以外的所有人，选择了和面具一起作为奥斯特鲁的生活。然后逃到恩中卡伊，看到了恢复的征兆的安珠，想要取回父亲的皇帝留下的皇女的地位而站起来。另一方面，大和趁着混乱，八柱将的来光拥立伪皇女，企图掌握国家。不久大和军的进攻，波及到了为了排除真正的皇女而去的延中宫……。卷入大和全境的战乱，拉开了帷幕…","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-07-09 22:48:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":41,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9b6GN6Qd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZr2N6e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4V380e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw7Qlwd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdy7v6wa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMWL63d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/lej59jRd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8Kjloa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw2kq8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Pdy2VnWe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQgPRYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb221JMb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Ddw2VN8b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaO6NRNe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aMXZOAe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/9aAKvxzd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/p